# Fixed local-only Supabase demo values for `supabase start` on the default
# config.toml (no custom JWT secret is set). These are Supabase's published
# local dev defaults, not secrets — useless against any real hosted project.
# Integration tests (npm run test:integration) require `supabase start` to
# already be running; they never touch a real/hosted project.
